      "content": "i know people want to help, but it's just so much work to explain it all again. it's exhausting just trying to justify why i'm so tired. it sometimes feels like the only way to actually get some peace, to truly stop the noise, is to just... not be here. like, if there's no more 'me', there's no more struggle. does that even make sense? like, isn't that just a logical way to find rest?",
